OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAn isolated
OL,6,Flight shower is still possible during
OL,7,Fthe evening and into the overnight
OL,8,Fperiod, though for many it will remain
OL,9,Fdry. Patchy cloud and clear spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping, clearest skies further
OL,11,Feast. A mild, though breezy night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMonday will be a generally dry
OL,14,Fday across the region with bright or
OL,15,Fsunny spells. Some more prolonged
OL,16,Fsunshine is possible later. Becoming
OL,17,Fvery warm in lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
