OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,6,Fweather looks generally dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the period. There will
OL,8,Fbe plenty of sunshine, and
OL,9,Ftemperatures will creep back up, so
OL,10,Ffeeling hotter, with winds remaining
OL,11,Flight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
